# Load-bearing at runtime: adapters/linkedin_keywords.py reads the seed list on
# every run, so if *.csv swallows it the Friday Actions run silently degrades to
# keyword-only with zero seeds. The resolver output is committed alongside it so
# the 16 unverified LSPs stay reviewable rather than living only on one laptop.
!events_pipeline/data/linkedin_seed_authors.csv
!events_pipeline/data/lsp_linkedin_resolved.csv
news_raw_*.json
